<title>USA: FGIC qualifies eight issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies eight issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Guaranty Insurance Co said it has qualified for bond insurance the following eight municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Mokena Comm. Park Dist., Ill., $4.5 million park general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--Saugus, Mass., $9.5 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Pender County, N.C., $9.5 million school GOs.</p>
<p>--Wake Forest, N.C., $2.395 million refunding Gos.</p>
<p>--Washoe County, Nev., $19 million public safety GOs.</p>
<p>--Poughkeepsie City, N.Y., $2.906 million public</p>
<p>--Easley, S.C., $3.3 million GOs.</p>
<p>--West Virginia, $57 million GOs.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
